  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed communication hub, by reason of its siting and design, would result in an unnecessary and harmful addition to street clutter within this section of the public footway, where similar structures already exist in close proximity. The cumulative impact of these features would detract from the established character of the High Street and diminish the quality of the public realm. The proposal is therefore contrary to London Plan Policy D8 (Public Realm) and SI6 (Digital Infrastructure and Connectivity), Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character) and CC5 (Advertisement Panels, Hoardings and Structures), EC4 (Telecommunications) and the aims of the National Planning Policy Framework."
